DATA AND REFERENCE OUTPUTS FROM CLIMPACT

Climpact (https://github.com/ARCCSS-extremes/climpact) is licensed GPL-3.0. This repository
contains no Climpact source code. It does use, with thanks, the following material:

* Sample station file. sydney_observatory_hill_1936-2015.txt (daily observations for Sydney
  Observatory Hill, as distributed with Climpact) is not stored in this repository.
  scripts/fetch_sample.sh downloads it unmodified from the Climpact repository at a pinned commit.
  It is the input of the tests, of the validation and of the "sample station" button, and a
  container image built from this repository contains a copy.
* Climpact's own reference outputs. The validation also reads the files under
  tests/output_compare/ of the Climpact repository (from the fetched checkout; not stored here).
* Reference outputs. The files under baseline/output/ and baseline/variants/*/output/ were
  produced by running the unmodified Climpact 3.4.4 on that sample file and on variants derived
  from it (baseline/README.md, baseline/make_variants.py, baseline/run_variants.sh). They are the
  expected values of the tests and of VALIDATION.md.
* Demonstration data. web/fixtures/*.json are answers of this software's API for the sample
  station, so they contain values derived from the sample file, including its daily series.
  The front end shows them in its demonstration mode.


